  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the visual metaphor of the hole in the brick wall",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the brick wall with a hole, which serves as a metaphor for the emotional gap experienced when trying to fit in with others. The textual material 'when i try to fit in with other people' explicitly uses 'i', which deictically anchors the experience to the user, making them the subject of the metaphor. The user identifies with the feeling of alienation represented by the hole, projecting their own experience onto the visual entity.",
